title: Character of the Party
subtitle: Where PPS builds its reach.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
card-image: img/polish/polish_party_electoral_base.jpg
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && !!Q.polish_party_rules && PolishParty.stanceAvailable(Q, 'electoral_base') !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card party.electoral_base (catalogue 4.5; technical reference 10.6): 1 T, 0 R, the card then waits 6 months. Z — 0.51: the present line can be
// confirmed for 1 T and the usual wait; returning the card to the hand is free. Z — 0.57 (item 6 of the play notes of
// 5 X 2026): "our own profile, and reach through allies" had no effect and is no longer offered.
PolishParty.stanceView(Q, 'electoral_base');
!}

= Character of the Party

The present line: **[+ pl_stance_current +]**. A new declaration costs this month's action; it changes no law in force and gives no reform by itself.

- @workers
- @workers_peasants
- @broad_democratic
- @easy_discard

@workers
title: A workers’ party
subtitle: [? if pl_stance_workers_present = 1 : **Present line** Confirming it costs this month's action and the card waits as after a change; nothing else changes. ?][? if pl_stance_workers_present = 0 : Reach grows faster in the three union branches and among the workers (+0.10). ?]
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.stanceStatus(Q, 'electoral_base', 'workers').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_stance_workers_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.stanceChoose(Q, 'electoral_base', 'workers');
!}
go-to: result

@workers_peasants
title: A party of workers and peasants
subtitle: [? if pl_stance_workers_peasants_present = 1 : **Present line** Confirming it costs this month's action and the card waits as after a change; nothing else changes. ?][? if pl_stance_workers_peasants_present = 0 : The same, and in the peasants’ cells. ?]
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.stanceStatus(Q, 'electoral_base', 'workers_peasants').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_stance_workers_peasants_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.stanceChoose(Q, 'electoral_base', 'workers_peasants');
!}
go-to: result

@broad_democratic
title: A broad democratic party
subtitle: [? if pl_stance_broad_democratic_present = 1 : **Present line** Confirming it costs this month's action and the card waits as after a change; nothing else changes. ?][? if pl_stance_broad_democratic_present = 0 : Reach grows faster among the intelligentsia and the petty bourgeoisie (+0.10). ?]
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.stanceStatus(Q, 'electoral_base', 'broad_democratic').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_stance_broad_democratic_why +]
